},[202,229,231],{"id":230},"contributing","Contributing",[191,233,234,235,224],{},"We welcome contributions to improve or expand language support. To add a language or fix translations, create an issue in the FiveNet GitHub project or join directly through ",[220,236,240],{"href":237,"rel":238},"https:\u002F\u002Fpoeditor.com\u002Fjoin\u002Fproject\u002Fhszo85uo3K",[239],"nofollow","FiveNet's POEditor project",[242,243,245],"h3",{"id":244},"how-to-add-a-new-language","How to add a new language",[247,248,249,252,277,289,292],"ol",{},[210,250,251],{},"Create an issue in the FiveNet GitHub project to discuss the language you want to add.",[210,253,254,255],{},"Include the following details in the issue:\n",[207,256,257,265,271],{},[210,258,259,260,264],{},"Language name (for example ",[261,262,263],"code",{},"French",")",[210,266,267,268,264],{},"Language code (for example ",[261,269,270],{},"fr",[210,272,273,274,264],{},"Language icon (for example ",[261,275,276],{},"i-flagpack-fr",[210,278,279,280],{},"After approval, the language will be added to POEditor.\n",[207,281,282],{},[210,283,284,285,224],{},"Then create a POEditor account and join through ",[220,286,288],{"href":237,"rel":287},[239],"the project link",[210,290,291],{},"You can then start translating the strings in the POEditor project.",[210,293,294,295],{},"Developers sync translations from POEditor to FiveNet regularly.\n",[207,296,297,300],{},[210,298,299],{},"After sync and release, the language becomes available in the app.",[210,301,302],{},"If you run into issues, create a GitHub issue or ask in the FiveNet Discord server.",[226,304],{},[306,307,311,319],"card",{"target":308,"title":309,"to":310},"_blank","FiveNet uses POEditor for translations","https:\u002F\u002Fpoeditor.com\u002F",[191,312,313,314,318],{},"Thanks to ",[220,315,317],{"href":310,"rel":316},[239],"POEditor"," for providing FiveNet with a free translation project!",[191,320,321],{},[197,322],{"alt":323,"src":324,":width":325,":zoom":326,"align":327},"POEditor Logo","\u002Fimages\u002Fpoeditor-logo.svg","150","false","center",{"title":329,"searchDepth":330,"depth":330,"links":331},"",2,[332,333],{"id":204,"depth":330,"text":205},{"id":230,"depth":330,"text":231,"children":334},[335],{"id":244,"depth":336,"text":245},3,"md",null,{},true,"\u002Fuser-guides\u002Fi18n",{"title":186,"description":193},"3.user-guides\u002F8.i18n","gpzHWxUl9YWlcWNf1eEWMJyuvB9mdfMeKR4iqdcUJ30",[346,351],{"title":347,"path":348,"stem":349,"description":350,"children":-1},"Settings","\u002Fuser-guides\u002Fsettings","3.user-guides\u002F7.settings","Learn how to configure and manage settings in FiveNet, including job properties, roles, permissions, and app-wide configurations.",{"title":352,"path":353,"stem":354,"description":329,"children":-1},"iOS App","\u002Fuser-guides\u002Fios-app","3.user-guides\u002F9.ios-app",1788932297278]